{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53537","headline":"拜禹庙 · 元稹","name":"拜禹庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恢能咨岳日，悲慕羽山秋。\n父陷功仍继，君名礼不雠。\n洪水襄陵後，玄圭菲食由。\n已甘鱼父子，翻荷粒咽喉。\n古庙苍烟冷，寒亭翠柏稠。\n马泥真骨动，龙画活睛留。\n祀典稽千圣，孙谋绝一丘。\n道虽污世载，恩岂酌沈浮。\n洞穴探常近，图书即可求。\n德崇人不惰，风在俗斯柔。\n茭色湖光上，泉声雨脚收。\n歌诗呈志义，箫鼓凟清猷。\n史亦明勳最，时方怒校酋。\n还希四载术，将以拯虔刘。\n（同前）（按：以上四首，卞孝萱《元稹年谱》、冀勤校《元稹集》均出揭出。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}